e to build up to big WoD video games that are much larger profit drivers than CYoA or IF games, and far more profitable than TTRPGs ever will be.<br /> <br /> Scion is owned by Onyx Path, a tiny TTRPG company that doesn't have the resources to make it happen on their own, and Scion has never had the cultural impact to get interest from larger companies that might offer Rich a decent deal on licensing Scion for a video game.<br /> <br /> It'd be awesome to see, but the odds are minuscule.</div> </div> </div> </div>To be fair, there\u2019s a company who licensed Scion to make a TV show. I don\u2019t think it\u2019s gotten past the announcement phase, but it\u2019s still a thing that is out there. I don\u2019t think a Choice of Games Scion title would be unrealistic, like there\u2019s a Pugmire one, but I agree OPP is probably focused on Curseborne for doing liscensed projects in other media.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25049-zakrulz","name":"ZakRulz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25049_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"238"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-08-21T15:25:03-07:00","id":1540858,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Heavy Arms</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1540744-you-guys-think-scion-will-ever-come-out-with-any-games-like-the-world-of-darkness?p=1540795#post1540795\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Not everyone on the forums follows every game-line equally to know what individual entries in other lines are.<br /> <br /> And frankly? No, we're probably not going to see Scion video games. The recent crop of WoD games are being pushed out by Paradox because Paradox is a video game company that's trying to reclaim the WoD's cultural prominence to build up to big WoD video games that are much larger profit drivers than CYoA or IF games, and far more profitable than TTRPGs ever will be.<br /> <br /> Scion is owned by Onyx Path, a tiny TTRPG company that doesn't have the resources to make it happen on their own, and Scion has never had the cultural impact to get interest from larger companies that might offer Rich a decent deal on licensing Scion for a video game.<br /> <br /> It'd be awesome to see, but the odds are minuscule.</div> </div> </div> </div>Wow...That's sad.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/28562-ofgreenprydain","name":"OfGreenPrydain","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":1,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2024"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"8"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}